### Chord API + Glamoriz tool server: requests for the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
### Keys are read from server/.env via $dotenv, so nothing secret lives in this file. Click "Send Request" above each one.
###
### Order of use:
###   1. Run "List teammates" → copy your teammate's `id` and `workspace_id` into server/.env
###      as CHORD_TEAMMATE_ID and CHORD_WORKSPACE_ID (and on Render).
###   2. Run "List MCP servers" → copy the Glamoriz server's `id` into CHORD_MCP_SERVER_ID.
###   The rest of the requests then use those values.

@chordUrl = https://api.chordhq.xyz
@apiKey = {{$dotenv CHORD_API_KEY}}
@workspaceId = {{$dotenv CHORD_WORKSPACE_ID}}
@teammateId = {{$dotenv CHORD_TEAMMATE_ID}}
@mcpServerId = {{$dotenv CHORD_MCP_SERVER_ID}}
@toolsUrl = https://test-chord-glamoriz.onrender.com
@mcpToken = {{$dotenv MCP_AUTH_TOKEN}}


############################################################
# 1. Find your IDs
############################################################

### List teammates: each has `id`, `workspace_id`, `lifecycle_state` and `mcp_server_ids`
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/teammates
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Get one teammate (use the id from the list)
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/teammates/{{teammateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Teammate's tool scope (which tools are On / Off / Needs connecting)
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/teammates/{{teammateId}}/tools
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Teammate's channels (WhatsApp simulator, in-app, ...)
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/teammates/{{teammateId}}/channels
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Teammate's skills: check both are published and `included`
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/teammates/{{teammateId}}/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


############################################################
# 2. MCP server (the Glamoriz tools)
############################################################

### List MCP servers in the workspace: copy the Glamoriz `id` (mcp-...) into CHORD_MCP_SERVER_ID
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/mcp-servers
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Register the Glamoriz tool server (skip if you already added it in the app)
POST {{chordUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/mcp-servers
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Glamoriz tools",
  "url": "{{toolsUrl}}/mcp",
  "auth_type": "bearer",
  "auth_token": "{{mcpToken}}",
  "transport": "streamable_http",
  "enabled": true
}

### Restrict the teammate to the Glamoriz server
PUT {{chordUrl}}/v1/teammates/{{teammateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "set_mcp_server_ids": ["{{mcpServerId}}"]
}

### Health-check the MCP server from Chord's side (wake Render up first with "Tool server health" below)
POST {{chordUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/mcp-servers/{{mcpServerId}}/health
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Discover the tools Chord sees on the server (expect 11)
POST {{chordUrl}}/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/mcp-servers/{{mcpServerId}}/tools
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


############################################################
# 3. Talk to the teammate through the API (no simulator needed)
############################################################

### Send a message as a test customer. Keep sender_id the same to continue the conversation.
POST {{chordUrl}}/v1/external-chat/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspace_id": "{{workspaceId}}",
  "teammate_id": "{{teammateId}}",
  "sender_id": "2348120000099",
  "text": "Hi, I have dark spots and oily skin. What do you recommend?"
}

### Returning customer (seeded): Ada Obi
POST {{chordUrl}}/v1/external-chat/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workspace_id": "{{workspaceId}}",
  "teammate_id": "{{teammateId}}",
  "sender_id": "2348030000001",
  "text": "Hello, it's me again"
}


############################################################
# 4. Conversations and follow-ups
############################################################

### Recent threads (conversations) in the workspace: the `id` is the conversation id for follow-ups
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/threads?workspace_id={{workspaceId}}&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Threads waiting for a human (after handover_to_human)
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/threads?workspace_id={{workspaceId}}&control_state=human_active
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Scheduled follow-ups queued by the tool server
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/scheduled-tasks?teammate_id={{teammateId}}&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}

### Credit usage so far
GET {{chordUrl}}/v1/usage
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


############################################################
# 5. Glamoriz tool server (direct, bypassing Chord)
############################################################

### Tool server health (also wakes Render from sleep)
GET {{toolsUrl}}/health

### List MCP tools
POST {{toolsUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "tools/list"}

### Call a tool: look up the seeded returning customer
POST {{toolsUrl}}/mcp
Authorization: Bearer {{mcpToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "get_customer", "arguments": {"phone": "0803 000 0001"}}}
